WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.680
It's Futami-senpai!

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.600
Oh yeah.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.330
Let's try waving.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.720
Wha? No way!

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.930
Huh, why not?

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.940
No no no, we have to leave.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.650
<i>These new earbuds are great.</i>

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.160
<i>I have to make sure not to lose these.</i>

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.760
Oh hey, Shun.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.600
Oh nice, do those wireless ones sound good?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.390
Yeah.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.970
But don't you worry about them falling out?

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.380
No, if you put them in 
properly, it's quite all right.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.420
They don't fall out when running, either.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.050
<b>Shake shake</b>

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:36.350
Even this kind of intense motion is okay.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:36.890
<b>Drop...</b>

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:37.640
<b>Knock</b>

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.600
<b>Fall----</b>

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:45.050
See? They're fine even if you 
drop them from this height.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.680
How are you so calm?

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.610
We gotta go look for it!

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.260
Before class starts!

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.020
You're lucky there's a planter down there!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:28.000
<b>#07
Loop</b>

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.940
Damn it, where is it?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:27.120
Geez.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.050
Oh!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.370
Here, found it.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:35.710
Why are you always like this?

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:39.000
<i>Well, this kind of blunder is nothing.</i>

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:39.850
<i>Happens all the time.</i>

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.300
<i>I'm more worried about what's coming.</i>

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.550
Gather up!

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.630
So starting tomorrow, we're going to suspend 
club activities until exams are over.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.910
Training by yourself is fine and all,

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.020
but make sure to take 
your studies seriously.

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:54.930
Anybody who gets failing grades won't be 
allowed to participate in practice, okay?

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:55.490
Got it!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.630
That's it for today.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.190
Good work!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.120
Futami.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.870
Even you know what I meant by that, right?

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.990
The tournament's coming up, 
 and you're a starter.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:11.050
Don't be super lame and 
fail anything, all right?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:11.750
<b>Called out</b>

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:15.760
Futami's <i>the</i> meathead here.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.420
No comeback when it's too true, huh?

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:24.320
But it's also true that we really need you,

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.150
so we don't want you to stumble 
because of something like that.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.300
Senpai...

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.370
Well, you're a bit too 
popular with the girls,

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.910
so I wouldn't hate it if you stayed dumb.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.530
For real.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:38.320
But do go and study for the team, okay?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.030
Was there ever a more heartless cheer?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:45.520
Aww, please don't pick on 
poor Shun-chan that much.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.440
That's <i>my</i> job.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.000
Supplementary exam

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.230
I mean, he really screwed the 
pooch in his first year,

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.200
so I'm always worried.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.630
<b>History
of failure</b>

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:01.060
It's fine. I'll get full marks
 across the board.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.180
Oh, I seriously doubt that.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.300
<b>Total
lie</b>

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.640
<i>Every single one of them!</i>

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.800
<i>Making fun of me!</i>

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.680
<b>Worry</b>

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:16.010
I was wondering why you came 
here so early on a day off.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.980
So your exams are coming up.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.400
I can't focus at home.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:23.090
I guess you would play with Sakura.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.440
How's she doing?

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:25.700
Well.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:29.130
Asami-san, two lunch specials, please.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.040
Got it.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.580
What are you doing, Shun?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.670
Studying?

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.180
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.490
Damn, this is hard.

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:38.790
No, it's not obvious. What is that?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.340
<b>Portrait of his 
beloved dog</b>

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:44.460
How rude to laugh at someone's drawing.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:49.000
I-I just was utterly unprepared because 
I thought you were studying...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.210
I'm starting to study now.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:54.630
Do you understand this stuff?

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.420
Math?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.420
I think I know it better than you, at least.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.590
I never had to take a supplementary exam.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.950
Speaking of, does your 
design school have exams?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:12.760
Huh? Well, there are some exams, but it's 
more like, project, project, project.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.280
Dang, really?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:18.380
It's hard work, but it's 
all stuff we like doing.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.950
You're a hard worker, huh?

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:22.930
I guess so.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.180
You do your best too, okay?

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.730
<i>I guess you have to pull.</i>

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.370
Welcome.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:27.720
<b>Turn</b>

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>He switched gears quick.</i>

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.630
How many people will be in your party?

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.750
Just me.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:34.980
Let me show you to your table, then.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.360
<i>He looks like a smart adult...</i>

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.970
<i>I bet someone like him has 
never had a bad grade, ever.</i>

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:41.650
<b>Stab</b>

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.280
What are you doing?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.610
If you're going to sit there, actually study.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.090
Making progress?

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:55.630
Making progress.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.470
Lies.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.540
<b>Lies</b>

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.200
Oh, yeah.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:03.130
The new part-timer who's starting 
today goes to Karatachi University.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.730
Maybe he can help you with
 anything you don't understand?

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.850
<i>Karatachi University?</i>

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.040
<i>That's a really elite school.</i>

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.000
<i>I wonder what kind of person he is.</i>

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.100
<b>Rattle</b>

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:17.000
Oh, you have to pull.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.390
Good morning.

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:23.850
<i>I always do that.</i>

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.810
<i>I just did that.</i>

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.090
Oh.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.190
Morning!

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.910
Oh, good morning.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.460
I'll show you the staff room first.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.330
Sure.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:38.790
For today, just getting to 
know this place will do.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.380
All right.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.460
You used to work in a pub before, right?

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.990
You'll be just fine.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:43.650
Right.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.320
<i>I feel like I've seen him before.</i>

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.720
<i>The university's close, so I guess 
we must have passed by each other.</i>

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.680
<b>Missed 
the straw</b>

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:51.890
<b>Eye contact</b>

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.700
Are you ready to order?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.190
Ah, Hayate-kun, that's my 
brother, so don't mind him.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.730
Oh, your brother.

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:05.570
And I'm really sorry to ask you for 
a favor on your first day, but...

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:12.490
<b>Boom</b>

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:12.490
<b>Effectively a tutor</b>

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.870
<i>I only wanted to ask a question or two...</i>

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.480
<i>What job did I come here for again?</i>

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.850
That's... math.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.440
Which part do you not understand?

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:19.270
Well, I don't know what I don't understand.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:21.520
So there probably isn't 
anything I don't understand.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.780
Then, can you answer question 1 there?

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.710
Nope.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:33.130
Ah, so that's how factorization works.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.370
Exactly.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.220
As long as you remember this, things 
should be easier going forward.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.850
You're really good at explaining things.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:44.000
As long as you understand the 
material that was covered in class,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.070
I believe you won't fail any exam in school,

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.510
so good luck.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:53.490
<b>Flip flip flip</b>

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.300
<i>So cool!</i>

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.340
<i>He's flipping through the 
pages so quickly, too!</i>

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.110
<i>Where was that page we were on before?</i>

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.680
I'm sorry, Hayate-kun.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.360
This was not part of the 
job description at all.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:07:59.530
It's fine.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.220
Shun's good at sports, 
but terrible in school.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.570
Don't praise and badmouth 
me in one sentence!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:08.350
So are you in a club or something?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.540
I do handball.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.240
I'm not allowed to join practice 
if I get a failing grade.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.710
The next tournament is the 
last one for the third-years.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.550
I'm on the starting team,

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.770
so I don't want to be dragging 
the team down with this.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.980
I want to keep winning as much as possible,

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.970
so that we can keep playing 
together just a little bit longer.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.310
Got it. Then let's do our best together.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.770
You're going to help me?

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:35.450
Thanks, teach!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.390
Teach...

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.200
<i>He's pretty pure, huh?</i>

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.380
Shun-kun, there's cute side to you, huh?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.780
What? What are you trying to say with that?

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.090
Oh, sorry.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.550
<i>I touched a nerve...</i>

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:51.050
Shun-chan, did something good happen?

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:54.500
You looked pretty dead yesterday
after you got grilled.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.960
I gained a powerful ally, so 
I can get those full marks.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:02.820
I wonder why it's always the simpletons who 
immediately try to aim for full marks.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:06.870
Well, as long as he can avoid failing.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:09.020
I'm worried about you, too.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.200
What did you say?!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:13.050
I'm always at least two 
points ahead of Futami!

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.930
I'll show you my notebook so you can 
see how hard I worked yesterday.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.740
I don't need to see it, but I 
think you want me to see it.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.280
Take a look at this.

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:21.190
<i>What is that?</i>

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.520
<i>Hey, Akai, tell him he 
flipped to the wrong page.</i>

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.270
<i>I can't bring myself to rain on his parade.</i>

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:28.960
<b>Snap</b>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Detour</b>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
